# Recorded 2026-10-08 from a throwaway slapd (OpenLDAP 2.7.1-0+slaptain1) by testdata/record.sh,
# run in the slaptain slapd-init image of the same vendored build the lab runs.
# Search: ldapsearch -b cn=Monitor -s sub '(objectClass=*)' '*' '+'
# Bound by SASL EXTERNAL over ldapi as the sidecar would be, under the
# constant monitor ACL of the ADR-033 2026-10-08 amendment. Unedited below this
# header: suffixes are RFC 2606 names, paths are the throwaway container's.
#
# Database 1 (dc=example,dc=org) was opened BEFORE the monitor database was
# added, so it carries no olmMDB*; Database 3 (dc=example,dc=net) was ADDed after
# it and carries all seven (ADR-033 amendment, 'create order').
#
